      "text": "%md\n## Neuro-Infiltrator: Multi-Floor Protocol - Deep RL Environment\n\n### 1. Overview\nA **Rogue-like Survival** grid-world built for Deep RL.\nEvery `reset()` produces a new procedural dungeon. The agent must learn generalizable skills.\n\n### 2. Observation Space - `Dict(\"visual\", \"vector\")`\n| Component | Shape | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `visual` | `(16, 9, 9)` float32 | 16-channel local-view tensor (radius 4) |\n| `vector` | `(15,)` float32 | 15-dim state vector (values tightly scaled to `[-1, 1]`) |\n\n**Visual Channels (16):**\n* **0:** Walls / Out-of-bounds\n* **1:** Traps\n* **2:** Doors\n* **3:** Stairs Up\n* **4:** Stairs Down\n* **5:** Goal\n* **6:** Keys\n* **7:** Health Packs\n* **8:** Ammo Packs\n* **9:** Agent (center marker)\n* **10:** Patrol Enemies\n* **11:** Chaser Enemies\n* **12:** Sniper Enemies\n* **13:** Projectiles (bullets)\n* **14:** Sniper Lasers\n* **15:** Spatial Memory (visited)\n\n**Vector Elements (15):**\n`[HP, Ammo, Stamina, HasKey, Noise, Floor, Target_dX, Target_dY, Target_dZ, Last_Dir_X, Last_Dir_Y, TimeRemaining, TargetDist, OnStair, EnemyProximity]`\n*(Note: All vector elements are normalized/clipped to the `[-1, 1]` range to optimize Neural Network training stability).*\n### 3. Action Space - `Discrete(10)`\n| ID | Action | Noise |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0-3 | Move UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT | 0 |\n| 4-7 | Shoot UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT | 10 |\n| 8 | Dash (2 cells, last dir) | 5 |\n| 9 | Use Stairs | 0 |\n\n### 4. Reward Design\n| Event | Reward | Terminal? | Event | Reward | Terminal? |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| step | -0.10 | No | kill_enemy | +10.0 | No |\\\n| wall | -0.50 | No | damage | -5.0 | No |\\\n| goal | +50.0 | Yes | death | -30.0 | Yes |\\\n| key | +5.0 | No | trap | -5.0 | No |\\\n| door_open | +5.0 | No | stairs | +3.0 | No |\\\n| door_locked | -0.50 | No | explore | +0.2 | No |\\\n| get_hp | +3.0 | No | get_ammo | +2.0 | No |\\\n| approach | +0.3 | No | | | |\n\n### 5. Curriculum (12 Levels)\n| Lv | Name | Grid | Floors | Enemies | New Mechanics |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Crawl | 7x7 | 1 | 0 | Navigation |\n| 2 | Walk | 9x9 | 1 | 0 | Larger map |\n| 3 | Trapper | 9x9 | 1 | 0 | Traps |\n| 4 | Locksmith | 11x11 | 1 | 0 | Universal Key-Door |\n| 5 | Explorer | 11x11 | 1 | 0 | Health \u0026 Ammo packs |\n| 6 | Climber | 13x13 | 2 | 0 | Multi-floor (Stairs) |\n| 7 | Scout | 13x13 | 2 | 1P | Combat intro |\n| 8 | Operative | 15x15 | 2 | 2P | Cross-floor puzzle |\n| 9 | Specialist | 15x15 | 2 | P+C | Multi-locks routing |\n| 10 | Infiltrator | 17x17 | 2 | 4 | Sniper enemies |\n| 11 | Shadow | 19x19 | 3 | 5 | 3-floors, Ricochet bullets |\n| 12 | God Mode | 21x21 | 3 | 6 | Everything combined |\n\n### 6. Enemy AI\n- **Patrol (P)**: FSM (Patrol -\u003e Investigate). Reacts to direct Line-of-Sight or moderate noise events (`noise \u003e 3`). Patrols across a set of waypoints.\n- **Chaser (C)**: FSM (Idle -\u003e Chase). Uses A* pathfinding. Activates via proximity (`distance \u003c\u003d 6`) or loud noise events (`noise \u003e 5`).\n- **Sniper (S)**: 3-tick laser charge then fires a cardinal projectile. Needs direct alignment with the Agent. Has a 3-step cooldown after firing.\n\n### 7. Key Mechanics \u0026 Resources\n- **Stealth \u0026 Noise**: Walk\u003d0, Dash\u003d5, Shoot\u003d10 noise. The Agent\u0027s internal noise level decays by 2 units per step.\n- **Stamina System**: Dashing costs 1 Stamina. The Agent naturally regenerates 1 Stamina every 5 steps.\n- **Unified Lock System**: A single type of Key and Door. Keys are stackable and consumed (1 per door) to open any blocking door across floors.\n- **Ballistics**: Cardinal projectiles. Depending on the level config, bullets can ricochet off walls (reversing x or y direction).\n- **Resources**: Health packs restore +1 HP. Ammo packs restore +2 Ammo (up to a max cap, usually 5).\n- **Procedural Generation**: Multi-floor BSP + Graph + Zoning (Spawn, Combat, Treasure, Exit) + Critical Path Blocking Doors pipeline.",
