      "text": "%pyspark\ndef act(a):\n    global obs\n    if env.done:\n        z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, \u0027Game Over! Press RESET\u0027); return\n    old_floor \u003d env.agent.floor\n    obs, r, term, trunc, info \u003d env.step(a)\n    update_ui()\n    if not env.agent.alive: z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, f\u0027DEATH! Score: {env.total_reward:.0f}\u0027)\n    elif info.get(\u0027win\u0027): z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, f\u0027WIN! Score: {env.total_reward:.0f}\u0027)\n    elif trunc: z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, \u0027Timeout!\u0027)\n    elif env.agent.floor !\u003d old_floor: z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, f\u0027Floor {env.agent.floor} ({r:+.1f})\u0027)\n    else: z.angularBind(\u0027status\u0027, f\u0027{env.ACT_NAMES[a]} ({r:+.2f})\u0027)\nprint(\"Action handler ready (10 actions)\")\n",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-03-10 17:22:08.417",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
